<title>USA: Transmation to buy EIL units for $22 mln.</title>
<headline>Transmation to buy EIL units for $22 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transmation Inc said on Wednesday it signed a definitive agreement to buy the sales and service divisions of EIL Instruments Inc for $22 million.</p>
<p>The purchase would bring Transmation's total annual sales volume to almost $100 million, the company said.</p>
<p>Transmation sells instruments used to monitor industrial processes.</p>
</text>
